    "image_with_text_AJLTaB": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_xqdJPD": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "About Our CEO",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "text_transform": true,
            "mobile_title_size": "normal"
          }
        },
        "text_GaMbkV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Timothy J. French, the eldest of four siblings, grew up in Martinez, CA - a suburban community in the San Francisco East Bay Area. Known for his hard work and natural talent in mathematics, his skills and dedication led him to UC Berkeley where he pursued a degree in Mechanical Engineering. However, he later chose to pursue a different path, following in his father's entrepreneurial footsteps.<\/p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "text_size": "middle"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_xqdJPD",
        "text_GaMbkV"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
