    "image_with_text_VPMpkG": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_FFWPBb": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Discovering a Fitness Niche at 19",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "text_transform": true,
            "mobile_title_size": "normal"
          }
        },
        "text_q9YLxa": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At 19, Tim found his niche in fitness equipment. Using money saved from years of hosting and waiting tables, he made his first fitness equipment deal. He bought a Bowflex exercise machine from Craigslist, stored it in his parents' garage, sold it on eBay, and shipped it to the customer. This marked the beginning of his journey in the fitness equipment business. <\/p><p>For several years, Tim operated a one-man business, buying and selling Bowflex machines \"as is\" on Craigslist and eBay.<\/p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "text_size": "middle"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_FFWPBb",
        "text_q9YLxa"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
        "@media screen and (max-width: 750px) {.gradient {padding-block: 24px; } .image-with-text__heading {font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px; } .image-with-text__text {margin-top: 0; } .grid-column-reverse {gap: 20px; }}"
      ],
