    "image_with_text_8Ff9tN": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_atdAJJ": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Expanding Horizons Into Different Markets",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "text_transform": true,
            "mobile_title_size": "normal"
          }
        },
        "text_xCqJFm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In 2019, Tim opened another Fitness Superstore location in Stockton, CA, and launched the French Fitness brand with the goal of offering high-quality equipment at more affordable prices.<br\/><\/p><p>Today, French Fitness provides a wide range of gym equipment, from floorings, treadmills, ellipticals, bikes, accessories, and strength training equipment to weights and more. Tim’s mission for French Fitness mirrors that of Fitness Superstore: to ensure every customer is satisfied and sees the value in their purchase.<\/p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "text_size": "middle"
          }
        }
      },
